[{"order":1,"type":"heading","text":"APK Size Reduction & ProGuard/R8 Optimization in Android (Java)"},{"order":2,"type":"paragraph","text":"Optimizing your Android application size is crucial for user acquisition and retention, especially in emerging markets with limited bandwidth and storage. R8 is the default code shrinker in Android Studio that performs shrinking, obfuscation, and optimization."},{"order":3,"type":"subheading","text":"Step 1: Enabling R8 in build.gradle"},{"order":4,"type":"paragraph","text":"To enable R8 code shrinking and optimization for your release build, configure your module-level build.gradle file as shown below."},{"order":5,"type":"code","text":"android {
    ...
    buildTypes {
        release {
            minifyEnabled true
            shrinkResources true
            proguardFiles getDefaultProguardFile('proguard-android-optimize.txt'), 'proguard-rules.pro'
        }
    }
}"},{"order":6,"type":"subheading","text":"Step 2: Configuring Custom ProGuard Rules"},{"order":7,"type":"paragraph","text":"When using Java reflection, third-party libraries, or serialization frameworks (like Gson or Retrofit), R8 might mistakenly remove or rename essential classes and methods. You must add specific keep rules in your proguard-rules.pro file."},{"order":8,"type":"code","text":"# Keep Retrofit models from being obfuscated
-keepattributes *Annotation*
-keepclassmembers class * {
    @com.google.gson.annotations.SerializedName <fields>;
}

# Keep custom views instantiated via XML
-keep public class * extends android.view.View {
    public <init>(android.content.Context);
    public <init>(android.content.Context, android.util.AttributeSet);
    public <init>(android.content.Context, android.util.AttributeSet, int);
    public void set*(...);
}"},{"order":9,"type":"subheading","text":"Step 3: Best Practices for Further Size Reduction"},{"order":10,"type":"bullet_point","text":"Enable App Bundles (AAB): Publish using Android App Bundles (.aab) instead of APKs to let Google Play generate optimized APKs tailored to specific device configurations."},{"order":11,"type":"bullet_point","text":"Vector Drawables: Replace heavy PNG and JPEG assets with Vector Drawables to significantly decrease the res/drawable footprint."},{"order":12,"type":"bullet_point","text":"Remove Unused Languages: Use resConfigs to restrict your app to only support the locales you explicitly target."},{"order":13,"type":"code","text":"android {
    defaultConfig {
        resConfigs "en", "es", "fr"
    }
}"}]
